# Rust workspace conventions

Follow `AGENTS.md` §3 (crate catalog: every crate under `crates/` or `brokers/` is a
workspace member using workspace inheritance), §4 (`thiserror` in libraries, no
`.unwrap()`/`.expect()` there; `anyhow` in binaries; `vam-runtime` targets
`x86_64-unknown-linux-musl`) and §5 (verification: `cargo check --workspace`,
`cargo test -p <crate>`, fmt and clippy).
